{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"诗篇","commonName":"诗篇","title":"诗篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8a6689b3544af059e6077f6a9b93d6c43499c5f9692b20ed9d590c493ca23457","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2449},"chapter":{"number":42,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["流落异乡者的祷告"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["可拉后裔作的训诲诗，交给乐长。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"上帝啊，我的心切慕你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像鹿切慕溪水。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我心里渴慕上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"渴慕永活的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我何时才能去朝见祂呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我昼夜以泪为食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人们整天讥笑我：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你的上帝在哪里？”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从前我与众人同行，带领大家去上帝的殿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在欢呼、感恩声中一起过节。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我回想这些事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心中无限忧伤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的心啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你为何沮丧？为何在我里面烦躁？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要仰望上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我还要赞美祂——我的救主，我的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"我的上帝啊，我心中沮丧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便在约旦之地、黑门山和米萨山想起你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的瀑布发出巨响，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"回荡在深渊之间，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的洪涛巨浪淹没我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"白天耶和华将祂的慈爱浇灌我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"夜间我歌颂祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向赐我生命的上帝祷告。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我对我的磐石上帝说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你为何忘记我？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为何要我受仇敌的攻击，使我哀伤不已呢？”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仇敌的辱骂刺骨钻心。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们整天对我说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你的上帝在哪里？”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的心啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你为何沮丧？为何在我里面烦躁？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要仰望上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我还要赞美祂——我的救主，我的上帝。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/42.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/43.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PSA/41.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}